==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|e|l}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-fin-pro|fi}} {{term/t|fiu-fin-pro|*elädäk}}, from {{etyl|urj-pro|fi}} {{term/t|urj-pro|*elä-}}. Cognate with Northern Saami {{term|eallit|lang=se}} and Hungarian {{term|lang=hu|él}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|e|lää|lang=fi}}
* {{IPA|[ˈe̞læː(ʔ)]|lang=fi}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=fi}} To [[live]], [[be]] [[alive]].
#: '''''Elän''' kuin viimeistä päivää.'' = ''I '''live''' as if this was the last day [of my life].''
# {{context|intransitive|lang=fi}} To [[live]] (''somewhere'').
#: '''''Olen elänyt''' koko ikäni tässä kaupungissa.'' = ''I '''have lived''' in this town for all my life.''

